                            	  1043:                 ;SEM CHECKSUM NESSE MOMENTO SEM COPIAR DADOS SO TESTANDO ENVIO
                            	  1044:            ;     BRA     Send_ACK
                            	  1045: ;******************************************************************************************
                            	  1046: 
